## Build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/

## Test evidence (screenshots, DOM dumps) — regenerated on every run
TestArtifacts/
TestResults/
*.trx

## Living documentation — regenerated on every run from the feature files
LivingDoc/

## Reqnroll-generated code-behind for the .feature files
*.feature.cs

## Machine-local configuration overrides. Never shared.
**/Configuration/local.json

## Browser profiles created by Normal-mode runs
BrowserProfiles/

## IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

## NEVER commit credentials.
## credentials.json is the real, filled-in file and is ignored here. credentials.template.json IS
## committed and must only ever contain empty values — that is the whole reason the two are separate.
## Safer still: keep the password and TOTP secret in user-secrets or the CI secret store, not in any file.
**/Configuration/credentials.json
secrets.json
*.secrets.json
